          %h3#InOrdinaryCohomology In ordinary cohomology
          %p
            The
            %em Serre spectral sequence
            or
            %em Leray-Serre spectral sequence
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectral+sequence"} spectral sequence
            for computation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+cohomology"} ordinary cohomology
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+homology"}> ordinary homology
            ) of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+spaces"} topological spaces
            in a
            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Serre+fibration"} Serre
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+sequence"} fiber sequence
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+spaces"} topological spaces
          %p
          #OrdinaryCohomologicalSerreSpectralSequence.num_prop
            %h6 Proposition
            %p
              %strong (ordinary cohomology Serre spectral sequence)
              %br/
            %p
              Given a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+fiber+sequence"} homotopy fiber sequence
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
