            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+%28Eilenberg-Steenrod%29+cohomology"} generalized (Eilenberg-Steenrod) cohomology
            is the
            = succeed "," do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Atiyah-Hirzebruch+spectral+sequence"} Atiyah-Hirzebruch spectral sequence
          %h3#InRelativeCohomology In relative cohomology
          %p
            There are two kinds of
            = succeed "." do
              %strong relative Serre spectral sequences
          %p
