            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/relative+cohomology"} relative cohomology
            of the base space of the form
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
